{"outcome":"component","existing":"","reason":"","code":"HistoryTimeline","label":"History timeline","description":"The milestones of a company's history in date order, each a date, a title, a text and an optional picture, joined by a vertical line. Use it on an about or history page to tell how the shop grew over the years.","props":"[{"name": "title", "type": "text", "label": "Heading", "max": 120}, {"name": "intro", "type": "html", "label": "Introduction", "help": "A short text shown above the timeline."}, {"name": "events", "type": "items", "label": "Milestones", "min": 2, "max": 24, "items": [{"name": "date", "type": "text", "label": "Date", "help": "A year or a date, written as it is read: 1987, spring 2005.", "required": true, "max": 40}, {"name": "title", "type": "text", "label": "Title", "required": true, "max": 100}, {"name": "text", "type": "html", "label": "What happened"}, {"name": "image", "type": "image", "label": "Picture"}, {"name": "image_alt", "type": "text", "label": "Alternative text of the picture", "help": "What the picture shows, in one sentence. Leave empty for a decorative picture.", "max": 200}]}]","sample":"{"title": "Notre histoire", "intro": "<p>De l’atelier familial à la boutique en ligne, voici les grandes étapes qui nous ont menés jusqu’à vous.</p>", "events": [{"date": "1987", "title": "L’ouverture de l’atelier", "text": "<p>Marie et Paul Durand ouvrent un petit atelier de maroquinerie à Clermont-Ferrand.</p>", "image": null, "image_alt": ""}, {"date": "1998", "title": "La première boutique", "text": "<p>L’atelier devient trop petit. Nous ouvrons une boutique en centre-ville, avec un espace de fabrication visible des clients.</p>", "image": null, "image_alt": ""}, {"date": "2009", "title": "Le lancement du site", "text": "<p>Nos sacs et nos ceintures sont désormais en vente en ligne, livrés partout en France.</p>", "image": null, "image_alt": ""}, {"date": "2016", "title": "Le label Entreprise du patrimoine vivant", "text": "<p>L’État récompense notre savoir-faire artisanal par ce label.</p>", "image": null, "image_alt": ""}, {"date": "2023", "title": "Un nouvel atelier", "text": "<p>Nous nous installons dans un atelier deux fois plus grand et accueillons six nouveaux artisans.</p>", "image": null, "image_alt": ""}]}","template":"<section class="timeline">{% if props.title is not empty %}<h2 class="timeline__title">{{ props.title }}</h2>{% endif %}{% if props.intro is not empty %}<div class="timeline__intro">{{ props.intro }}</div>{% endif %}<ol class="timeline__list" data-cms-sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 24rem, 90vw">{% for event in props.events %}<li class="event"><p class="event__date">{{ event.date }}</p><h3 class="event__title">{{ event.title }}</h3>{% if event.image %}<img class="event__image" src="{{ event.image }}" alt="{{ event.image_alt|default('') }}" loading="lazy">{% endif %}{% if event.text is not empty %}<div class="event__text">{{ event.text }}</div>{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ol></section>","css":".timeline__title { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
.timeline__intro { margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--cms-color-text-muted); }
.timeline__list { position: relative; margin: 0; padding: 0 0 0 2rem; list-style: none; }
